{"data": [{"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2114469098511851520", "3_2114469098537078784"]}, "author_id": "1986901942216630272", "created_at": "2026-10-25T21:28:14.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114469106497753155"], "id": "2114469106497753155", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 143, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "$AMKR  $39.30 — NVIDIA packaging is real. $58 chase is not.\n\nAmkor broke under the lower daily Keltner ($40.55) and sits −4.41% under dynamic VWAP ($41.11). Weekly Bearish. Vol acceleration on the way down. Weekly cloud still at $57.53–$62.90.\n\nThat’s the setup. Not the trade. https://t.co/GZGBWWnePU", "url": "https://x.com/seahorse_anton/status/2114469106497753155"}, {"author_id": "1373569238061912069", "created_at": "2026-10-25T21:38:04.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114471581158412619"], "id": "2114471581158412619", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 519, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "AIトレンドニュース要点（CTEE記事）\n詳細は該当するCTEE抽出記事Noを参照のこと\n\n1．テーマ別・特性別の統合要約\n\nI．先進封装・テスト：NVIDIAが資金を供給し、将来の能力を確保\n\nAIチップの供給能力を確保するため、\n\n　NVIDIAが封装・テスト企業の増産を", "url": "https://x.com/Nikola_pn2501/status/2114471581158412619"}, {"article": {"title": "AI 学习笔记之 Where is the money?"}, "author_id": "53785964", "created_at": "2026-10-25T21:45:47.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114473522777006309"], "id": "2114473522777006309", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 263, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "AI 学习笔记之 Where is the money? https://t.co/Sidhk1tolC", "url": "https://x.com/jliu18/status/2114473522777006309"}, {"author_id": "168954146", "created_at": "2026-10-25T22:00:04.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114477115521511891"], "id": "2114477115521511891", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 4, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "The projected profit potential for $ASML $BAC $WFC is between 5% and 10%.\n\nFor more details, please add my assistant on WhatsApp:https://t.co/3pPSkJ7PEo \n\nYou will also receive free daily real-time trading alerts, market analysis, and battle-tested", "url": "https://x.com/andresparam/status/2114477115521511891"}, {"author_id": "1680092936544092160", "created_at": "2026-10-25T21:00:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114462000944238968"], "id": "2114462000944238968", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 97, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "AI时代，谁才是真正的卖铲人？\n\n英伟达NVDA、博通AVGO、台积电TSM、阿斯麦ASML。\n\n如果未来10年只能持有其中一只。\n\n你选谁？", "url": "https://x.com/DesertCamelX/status/2114462000944238968"}, {"author_id": "1543510092447813635", "created_at": "2026-10-25T21:07:29.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114463882362376584"], "id": "2114463882362376584", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 16, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Bernstein thinks Samsung's Q3 HBM revenue ($8.7B) passed SK hynix ($7.6B).\n\nCatch: it's modeled off Korean export data, not reported numbers.\n\nWe find out Oct 28/29. Either way, HBM being a 2-horse race isn't a meme anymore. IYKYK\n\nhttps://t.co/Sgztv76VP1", "url": "https://x.com/rokhardsolid/status/2114463882362376584"}, {"author_id": "1968302536697217024", "created_at": "2026-10-25T21:05:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114463258480701456"], "id": "2114463258480701456", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 347, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "samsung is reportedly charging up to ~25% more than micron and hynix for HBM, and customers are paying it\n\nnot long ago the whole story was samsung falling behind in HBM. memory is such a strange business", "url": "https://x.com/_stockResearch/status/2114463258480701456"}, {"author_id": "1962246440975052800", "created_at": "2026-10-25T21:19:33.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114466920363876646"], "id": "2114466920363876646", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 7, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "$ASML says demand exceeds supply through 2028 and is exploring 110+ EUV tools that year. CFET transitions past gate-all-around guarantee multi-node litho intensity no index basket replicates. Only China normalization and High-NA dilution cap it.", "url": "https://x.com/quantumboomnow/status/2114466920363876646"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2114466574987878400"]}, "author_id": "1614608796973928448", "created_at": "2026-10-25T21:18:11.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114466577533780363"], "id": "2114466577533780363", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 6, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "SEDEX에서 삼성과 SK가 HBM4E를 보여줬는데 핀 속도가 최대 16Gbps까지 올라갔더라고.\n\n대역폭은 3.6TB/s에 12단 제품이 48GB라니 용량도 꽤 커졌네.\n\nUBS 보고서 보니까 삼성 D램 웨이퍼가 올해 4분기 70만 장에서 내년 4분기 82만 장으로 늘어나는데 대부분이 HBM 쪽으로 간다는 거야.\n\n2분기 HBM https://t.co/Yi9z9RpRJx", "url": "https://x.com/Richdorai/status/2114466577533780363"}, {"author_id": "940152416212791296", "created_at": "2026-10-25T21:06:19.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114463592724746404"], "id": "2114463592724746404", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 29, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "I have created an exclusive WhatsApp group for shareholders and active traders of $MDT  \n$ASML\n  $SNOW —a space for us to connect, share insights, and stay updated on the latest developments.\nCome join the discussion on stock market trends!\n\n🔗https://t.co/imMNNZUnBC\n\nClick the", "url": "https://x.com/Riga2018/status/2114463592724746404"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2114461627861073920", "3_2114461627903016960"]}, "author_id": "1771023291399958528", "created_at": "2026-10-25T20:58:33.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114461634798481573"], "id": "2114461634798481573", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 368, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Oil dumping, stock perps ripping across the board\n\nare we about to get an absolute god candle Monday or what?\n\n$AAOI $NBIS $MU $SKHY $NVDA $SNDK $ORCL $MRVL $BE $CRWV $IREN $ASML https://t.co/tfJNATkgWS", "url": "https://x.com/NexusCoOfficial/status/2114461634798481573"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2114464505501745152"]}, "author_id": "2112866982249058304", "created_at": "2026-10-25T21:10:15.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114464581750063374"], "id": "2114464581750063374", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 4, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "HBM、さすがの広帯域っすなあ https://t.co/e9GvCLxaly", "url": "https://x.com/mken1024/status/2114464581750063374"}, {"author_id": "1235248732440064000", "created_at": "2026-10-25T21:00:41.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114462171400659217"], "id": "2114462171400659217", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 21, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Data Center Customers Are Reportedly Footing A Bigger Bill For A Superior HBM Supply Chain, Where Samsung Has An Edge, As It’s Estimated To Charge Up To 25% Extra\n\nhttps://t.co/pJ0KyEb9JW", "url": "https://x.com/NewMaxxSSD/status/2114462171400659217"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2114467920327921664"]}, "author_id": "920509164857774081", "created_at": "2026-10-25T21:27:05.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114468814914216214"], "id": "2114468814914216214", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 3, "impression_count": 1110, "like_count": 9, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 1}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2114166252189155641", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "キヤノンはASMLが手薄のi線(365nm)を上手く市場開拓出来たと言うことかも\n\n※キヤノンの2017年～2022年の機種別台数は探し方が良くないのか見つからず・・ https://t.co/wzQegLfReB https://t.co/R95oKZHgCQ", "url": "https://x.com/Johoshushupopo/status/2114468814914216214"}, {"author_id": "1543510092447813635", "created_at": "2026-10-25T21:07:08.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114463794533454310"], "id": "2114463794533454310", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 16, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Korea memory earnings week: SK hynix Oct 28, Samsung Oct 29. Street sees ~₩185T combined Q3 OP.\n\nSleeper detail: LTAs are spreading to mobile DRAM. Meritz sees key-customer mobile memory prices +50% QoQ in Q1.\n\nYour next phone is paying for HBM 😆\n\nhttps://t.co/rXCEHnHKpe", "url": "https://x.com/rokhardsolid/status/2114463794533454310"}, {"author_id": "1630283681284669445", "created_at": "2026-10-25T20:57:01.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114461250868371904"], "id": "2114461250868371904", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 2566, "like_count": 8, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 4, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "Core themes you should be watching now during this pullback: \n\nHBM/NAND\nBurn-in &amp; Testing\n1.6T / 3.2T \nCW Lasers\nCPO \nActuators \nPhysical AI Perception\nBTM Fuel Cells\nABF Substrates &amp; PCBs\nEdge AI Compute", "url": "https://x.com/MMMTwealth/status/2114461250868371904"}, {"author_id": "1319133042", "created_at": "2026-10-25T21:10:22.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114464607909892570"], "id": "2114464607909892570", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 15, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "I have created an exclusive WhatsApp group for shareholders and active traders of $QCOM  \n$STX\n  $ASML —a space for us to connect, share insights, and stay updated on the latest developments.\nCome join the discussion on stock market trends!\n\n🔗https://t.co/dVlrUGDLkB\n\nClick the", "url": "https://x.com/rwmosmadrid/status/2114464607909892570"}, {"author_id": "1509910841000443914", "created_at": "2026-10-25T21:24:15.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114468103325458629"], "id": "2114468103325458629", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 36, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Kijk eens naar Sony MSX HBM-16 16K RAM expansion memory cartridge\n\n€ 80,20\n\n https://t.co/nqoXPTlJzY #eBay via @eBay", "url": "https://x.com/ClassicCompShop/status/2114468103325458629"}, {"author_id": "215895007", "created_at": "2026-10-25T21:05:01.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114463263526105480"], "id": "2114463263526105480", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 3, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "2/5 Copper taps out fast. At AI speeds, signal dies after about 1.5 millimeters, which is why HBM gets bolted onto the GPU. Marvell's Photonic Fabric swaps copper for light, so memory stops being a neighbor and starts being a network.", "url": "https://x.com/juzzzzzzzzzzy/status/2114463263526105480"}, {"author_id": "83436293", "created_at": "2026-10-25T21:12:41.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114465192616907171"], "id": "2114465192616907171", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 0, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "TSMCの技術動向は、半導体産業の未来を読み解く上で欠かせない。", "url": "https://x.com/knarfiras/status/2114465192616907171"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2114471851846148096", "3_2114471851829452800"]}, "author_id": "518672574", "created_at": "2026-10-25T21:39:11.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114471863284076620", "2114472290310295729"], "id": "2114471863284076620", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 14, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "$MU is still printing cash while the market tries to remember the last cycle.\n\nGross margins ~80%, debt to assets near zero, and free cash flow that just went vertical. Valuation has compressed to ~12x earnings despite the surge. HBM demand is real and the company controls scarce https://t.co/OpfhAU0zJf", "url": "https://x.com/RahulChitkaraRC/status/2114471863284076620"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2114472969099517952"]}, "author_id": "2089058635145957376", "created_at": "2026-10-25T21:43:36.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114472975139254713"], "id": "2114472975139254713", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "La crescente domanda di chip avanzati per l’intelligenza artificiale sta rafforzando il ruolo strategico di TSMC, uno dei principali produttori mondiali di semiconduttori… https://t.co/QW3R7rCDE7 https://t.co/Wauv07ws9o", "url": "https://x.com/Vyrazon/status/2114472975139254713"}, {"author_id": "1497756789789835271", "created_at": "2026-10-25T21:16:58.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114466270620090400"], "id": "2114466270620090400", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 7, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2114454896573566991", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "HBM 회사의 특별이익을 일반직원 성과급으로 연봉*OOO% 식으로 나누어주는 것은 경영실책, 배임행위이다. 순손실이 발생할 때도 유상증자 등으로 회사의 위험을 감수한 주주에게 당연히 돌아가야 할 현금을 보너스로 비용처리하다니.\n\n심지어 지급 대상이 PM이나 핵심 인재가 아니라 전체 직원에게 https://t.co/gJYl2yyCRt", "url": "https://x.com/BenParkInvest/status/2114466270620090400"}, {"author_id": "1711855515914113024", "created_at": "2026-10-25T21:59:54.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114477076766138619"], "id": "2114477076766138619", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 258, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "🎉코스피 긍정 시나리오\n\n실적발표 시즌에 모멘텀 받아서 \n→ 거래량, 거래대금 둘 다 터지면서 상승 전환\n→ 이란 전쟁, 러-우 전쟁 수습 국면\n→ HBM영업이익률 좋게 나오면서 이익 불안 해소\n→ 6000선까지 회복\n\n😱코스피 부정 시나리오\n\n실적발표 시즌 뭐가 나오든 부정적 해석\n→ 거래량,", "url": "https://x.com/Myeongsu_bean/status/2114477076766138619"}, {"author_id": "1614608796973928448", "created_at": "2026-10-25T22:00:45.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114477289392005291"], "id": "2114477289392005291", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 4, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2114133748308435122", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "2년 된 엔비디아 칩, 몸값이 오히려 올랐어요\n\n\"2024년산 H200을 빌리는 값이 연초보다 약 160% 비싸졌다.\"\n\na16z 자료를 인용한 글인데요, 보통 GPU는 나오고 나면 값이 쭉 떨어지는 게 정상이잖아요.\n\n근데 AI 수요가 공급을 계속 앞지르면서 구형 칩까지 귀한 몸이 된 거죠.\n\nGPU 클라우드 업체 https://t.co/GUgNO5dlz6", "url": "https://x.com/Richdorai/status/2114477289392005291"}], "includes": {"media": [{"media_key": "3_2114469098511851520", "type": "photo"}, {"media_key": "3_2114469098537078784", "type": "photo"}, {"media_key": "3_2114466574987878400", "type": "photo"}, {"media_key": "3_2114461627861073920", "type": "photo"}, {"media_key": "3_2114461627903016960", "type": "photo"}, {"media_key": "3_2114464505501745152", "type": "photo"}, {"media_key": "3_2114467920327921664", "type": "photo"}, {"media_key": "3_2114471851846148096", "type": "photo"}, {"media_key": "3_2114471851829452800", "type": "photo"}, {"media_key": "3_2114472969099517952", "type": "photo"}], "users": [{"id": "1986901942216630272", "name": "Anton", "username": "seahorse_anton"}, {"id": "1373569238061912069", "name": "シェットランドシープドッグ", "username": "Nikola_pn2501"}, {"id": "53785964", "name": "Wondering Cloud", "username": "jliu18"}, {"id": "168954146", "name": "Warren Cole", "username": "andresparam"}, {"id": "1680092936544092160", "name": "沙漠骆驼🐪", "username": "DesertCamelX"}, {"id": "1543510092447813635", "name": "Oknor", "username": "rokhardsolid"}, 